chema"}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788158770071},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created exactly two output files in `out/`:\n\n- `out/root_cause.json`\n- `out/triage_notes.md`\n\nAssessment:\n\n- Root cause service: `auth-gateway`\n- Root cause change: `AUTH-2026-0318`\n- Confidence: high\n- Dependency path: `checkout-web → payment-api → auth-gateway`\n- Primary failure: `partner-v2` tokens rejected because `auth-gateway` still allowed only `partner-v1`\n\nVerification completed:\n\n- JSON parses successfully.\n- All required top-level fields are present.\n- Evidence contains five source observations.\n- `triage_notes.md` cites five fixture files and distinguishes observed facts from inferences.\n- Output directory contains exactly two files.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0319f80216253009016a952332e37887d2b997936eb84a7a89\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-luna","usage":{"input":629,"output":154,"cacheRead":23296,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24079,"cost":{"input":0.00012580000000000002,"output":0.0001848,"cacheRead":0.00046592,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0007765199999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1788158770077,"responseId":"resp_0319f80216253009016a952332623c87d299b1d21ac38228a4","duration":3763.4585850000003,"ttft":876.2327220000006}],"isTerminal":true}
